[Max Cash]
author=Codejunkies (via European CodeBase)
description=[TESTED] [CODE CAVE + HOOK] Sets cash to the maximum. Hook at 0x005D0148 jumps to a small cave at 0x000FFF00; the code leaves 0x000FFF0C and 0x000FFF18-0x000FFF20 unwritten and relies on them being empty (nop). Saved to the memory card.
